  {
   "text": "This is today's Item Shop for November 3rd.",
   "t0": 0.2,
   "t1": 2.25
  },
  {
   "text": "Three things before you spend a single V-Buck!",
   "t0": 2.38,
   "t1": 4.275
  },
  {
   "text": "The Adventure Time Bundle:",
   "t0": 4.495,
   "t1": 5.56
  },
  {
   "text": "3,800 V-Bucks, instead of 10,300.",
   "t0": 5.67,
   "t1": 8.65
  },
  {
   "text": "Dante and Rosa are in the shop.",
   "t0": 8.96,
   "t1": 10.49
  },
  {
   "text": "Both from Chapter 1, Season 6.",
   "t0": 10.6,
   "t1": 12.355
  },
  {
   "text": "And four skins are on their last day, three of them Epic.",
   "t0": 12.62,
   "t1": 15.0
  },
  {
   "text": "Buying anything today?",
   "t0": 15.325,
   "t1": 16.246
  },
  {
   "text": "Use code BAD in the Item Shop. It really helps the channel.",
   "t0": 16.306,
   "t1": 19.236
  },
  {
